---
title: Trading desk - adopted execution and separate forward research
---
flowchart TB
    Providers[Market and economic sources<br/>bars, filings, releases, calendar] --> Store[(As-of market store)]
    Store --> Models[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>release and economic judgments, briefs]
    Store --> Grades[Analyst ranks and grades<br/>measured numerical rules]
    Models --> Grades
    Grades --> Plan[Adopted scheduled allocation<br/>risk caps and FOMC policy]
    Plan --> Journal[(Paper intent and fill journal)]
    Journal --> Broker[Alpaca paper only<br/>scheduled orders and event recovery]
    Broker --> Journal
    Grades --> Records[(Dated desk records<br/>and completed 15-minute observations)]
    Plan --> Records
    Records --> View[Dashboard<br/>dated plan actions and manual position recording]
    Journal --> View
    Quotes[Read-only bid/ask and session clock<br/>SIP preferred; IEX identified] --> View
    Holdings[(Saved personal positions)] --> View
    Records --> Research[(Immutable research decisions<br/>entry states and candidate allocations)]
    Quotes --> Research
    Research --> Evidence[Forward evaluation<br/>grade outcomes and funded target trackers]
    Store --> Evidence
    Evidence --> View
    Research --> Shadow[(Separate board paper ledger<br/>USD, delayed simulated fills, action gates)]
    Plan --> Shadow
    Shadow --> View
    Research --> Audit[RL readiness audit<br/>research only; no policy promotion]
    Store --> Pilot[Isolated daily neural and RL pilot<br/>net wealth, pre/post-event evaluation]
    Pilot --> Artifacts[(Research run artifacts<br/>frozen models and account paths<br/>no automatic promotion)]
    Artifacts --> Frozen[Frozen validation-selected neural model<br/>nightly NumPy inference]
    Store --> Frozen
    Frozen --> MLForward[(Independent prospective accounts<br/>ML, rules, SPY, USD; delayed fills)]
    MLForward --> View

